    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Oranges—and everything we make from them—are big business. But right now, the industry is facing a difficult choice. There aren’t enough oranges "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "available",
            "ref": "v-available"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", so their "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b1",
            "number": 1
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " have recently reached a record high. "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b2",
            "number": 2
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " this, orange juice makers are considering using other "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "citrus",
            "zh": "柑橘属"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " fruits to make the drink."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "One big reason for this shortage is the bad "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b3",
            "number": 3
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " in Brazil. The country produces nearly 70% of the oranges we use for juice. But this year, their harvest is expected to be 24% lower than last year, marking the third year "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "in a row",
            "zh": "连续地"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " with a "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b4",
            "number": 4
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " harvest."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Also, orange trees in Brazil have been "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "affected",
            "ref": "v-affect"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " by citrus greening disease. It’s one of the worst diseases for citrus trees. When an orange tree is sick, its fruit tastes bitter. And "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b5",
            "number": 5
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", there’s no "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "cure",
            "ref": "v-cure"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " for this disease yet. Sick trees usually die within a few years."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "“This is a crisis,” said Kees Cools, president of the International Fruit and Vegetable Juice Association. “We’ve never seen anything like it.”"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Normally, when there aren’t enough oranges, juice makers can "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b6",
            "number": 6
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " the new crop with frozen juice. But after three years of poor harvests, that won’t be "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b7",
            "number": 7
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Another solution, according to Cools, is to make orange juice from "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "mandarins",
            "zh": "柑橘"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " instead."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "However, not everyone is "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b8",
            "number": 8
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " about this “solution”. Some people argue that using other fruits would increase transportation costs. This would "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b9",
            "number": 9
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " the price of juice. And when prices go up, people might buy less juice than they used to. "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b10",
            "number": 10
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", there wouldn’t be as much money to "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "invest",
            "ref": "v-invest"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " in planting new orange trees."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
